{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FZYeFUM_Rxh9x2xE0tCJBw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:27.442398+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FZYeFUM_Rxh9x2xE0tCJBw","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iadGcHegc7t1oCcnW18WtpxpWlM6KT50hOfzemwRf3EW1GGcsYibLjibaUbmzCjv959CZ0k99Q966jnFKnHerS4J9GErTQic7dXj3mKyPicslVbw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3KJncK30v9heGHEy5EGEHhibterk2cNg1FYuIqDZNSDK7WFX1vYHGvmibPL5SGw7Hn3jQ0W6kIQbH5z2T5HkDMJXStErXmAD1Fs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0NY3EbMibOxCorsvLb2wuoLHaBVroyMudezOpgES1aHxjw9NRpQ62MjXwKLykRROFiac4uR4QQ9wMAkRdvoFVGD05joFVkWicIgY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>数学与统计学院</span></span></strong><span>前身可追溯到建校初期的数学教研室。1979年开始“军事技术运筹学”硕士研究生培养。1993年，应用数学系、应用物理系和应用力学系三系合并组建理学院，应用数学系下设高等数学及应用数学教研室、计算数学教研室、公算（概率与统计）教研室、生物数学教研室（生物数学研究中心）。2021年，理学院的数学系、统计与金融数学系、大学数学基础教学中心、南京理工大学数学实验中心合并，正式成立南京理工大学数学与统计学院。</span></p><p><span>学院下设</span><strong><em><span><span>3</span></span></em></strong><span>个系和</span><strong><em><span><span>3</span></span></em></strong><span>个中心，建有复杂系统的数学理论分析与建模工业和信息化部重点实验室、江苏省外国专家工作室等省部级平台。学院现有教职工</span><strong><em><span><span>110</span></span></em></strong><span>余人，专任教师</span><strong><em><span><span>90</span></span></em></strong><span>余人，博士生导师</span><strong><em><span><span>30</span></span></em></strong><span>人，硕士生导师</span><strong><em><span><span>34</span></span></em></strong><span>人，教授</span><strong><em><span><span>22</span></span></em></strong><span>人，副教授</span><strong><em><span><span>45</span></span></em></strong><span>人。学院拥有国家级人才计划</span><strong><em><span><span>5</span></span></em></strong><span>人、全国师德先进个人</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人、享受国务院政府特殊津贴</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>人、江苏省教学名师</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人、江苏省特聘教授</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人、江苏省优秀青年基金项目获得者</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>人、江苏省“青蓝工程”中青年学科带头人</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人、江苏省“青蓝工程”优秀青年骨干</span><strong><em><span><span>4</span></span></em></strong><span>人、江苏省双创博士</span><strong><em><span><span>11</span></span></em></strong><span>人等人才。承担国家级项目</span><strong><em><span><span>8</span></span></em></strong><strong><em><span><span>0</span></span></em></strong><span>余项、省部级项目</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><strong><em><span><span>0</span></span></em></strong><span>余项。</span></p><p><span>学院现有数学一级学科博士学位授权点和应用统计学一级学科硕士学位授权点，设有数学一级学科博士后流动站，招收应用统计学专业硕士。数学学科先后入选江苏省“十三五”和“十四五”重点学科，2023年进入ESI全球前</span><strong><em><span><span>1%</span></span></em></strong><span>。近几年每年指导学生发表SCI(E)收录学术论文</span><strong><em><span><span>70</span></span></em></strong><span>余篇，获江苏省优秀博士学位论文</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>篇、优秀硕士学位论文</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>篇。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1GoS6EsYn6MPayuzANOU0VES8ktN0icHbvOclSdLonlLRNbR7Uzg0gKlcObeToicFibARzNZv0TY28l4ueLmxOLMppZjZgCpnYrg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t13OXW5Dxsr4hzzy2m7skYXofdqRmNXibwqR2xT5sz9UiaAT8wCx5ytpNklrNpbdUc47yVAibEQnW7cn8ddUW4Q0sbLB5icSuvZRKA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>300人左右</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请时间</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2026年7月6日-7月13日</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2027年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好（四六级成绩或其他资格考试证明）；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业为数学与应用数学、信息与计算科学、统计学及相近专业，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>5</span></strong></span><strong><span>.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，学院根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过邮件方式进行通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）《南京理工大学2026年校园开放日申请情况表》；</span></p><p><span>（2）身份证、学生证复印件；</span></p><p><span>（3）由教务处或所在院系开具的成绩单和总评成绩排名证明（以大学前5学期成绩计，加盖公章）；</span></p><p><span>（4）英语等级证书扫描件（四六级/雅思/托福等）；</span></p><p><span>（5）其它能证明本人成绩及潜力的材料，如校级及以上获奖证书、公开发表的学术论文、资格证书等复印件。</span></p><p><span>以上材料按序扫描合并成一个PDF文件，文件名称格式：</span><span><strong><span>未来意向申报专业（数学/应用统计）-2026开放日-本科就读高校-姓名</span></strong></span><span>，要求</span><strong><span><span>有目录和页码</span></span></strong><span>等，于</span><strong><span><span>7月13日</span></span></strong><span>前通过电子邮件发送至：</span><strong><span><span>130yz@njust.edu.cn</span></span></strong><span>，同时加入2027年度南理工数学与统计学院校园开放日咨询群</span><span><strong><span>QQ群：650549401。</span></strong></span></p><p><span>所提交的材料必须保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，将取消申请资格。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2scm086pEhVOXI9KoBWmSibcySXFdTFwyoiakrHuHXeaTAfFicZcCNGMx0P9ozKv3yMQI73kBd9vGvJbIj7QLic4rr23QFpsKb6E4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>田老师</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联</span></strong><strong><span><span>系电话</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>025-84315601</span></p></se